plaintext
* SPICE Netlist
* Voltage Sources
V1 1 0 DC 12V
V2 4 0 DC 5V

* Resistors
R1 1 5 2R
R2 5 0 R
R3 1 3 3R
R4 3 0 R
R5 2 4 1k

* Op-Amps (339)
XU1 5 2 4 0 OPAMP
XU2 3 2 4 0 OPAMP

* .OPAMP is a placeholder for the op-amp model specification.

* Nodes
* 1 = VCC (+12V)
* 2 = Common input
* 3 = Lower Resistor network
* 4 = Vout
* 5 = Upper Resistor network

.END